15:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10 flex w-full max-w-[700px] flex-col gap-6 pb-[60px] md:mt-14 lg:mt-20 lg:pb-[100px]","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"font-chiron text-[18px]/[28px] text-brown md:text-[20px]/[32px]","children":"Ask any of our regulars and they’ll tell you: the coffee is only half of it. The other half is the ritual. It’s the familiar walk, the favourite takeaway cup and the friendly hello at the counter."}],["$","h2","1",{"className":"pt-4 font-autour text-[26px]/[36px] text-brown md:text-[30px]/[42px] lg:text-[32px]/[44.8px]","children":"Make your pickup a small ritual"}],["$","p","2",{"className":"font-chiron text-[18px]/[28px] text-brown md:text-[20px]/[32px]","children":"A favourite beverage can brighten a busy day. Pick it up on your morning walk or between errands, and enjoy a small moment as you go."}],["$","h2","3",{"className":"pt-4 font-autour text-[26px]/[36px] text-brown md:text-[30px]/[42px] lg:text-[32px]/[44.8px]","children":"Pick your sip"}],["$","p","4",{"className":"font-chiron text-[18px]/[28px] text-brown md:text-[20px]/[32px]","children":"Rituals love consistency. Find a beverage you love, or switch between coffee, matcha and coolers as your mood changes."}],["$","blockquote","5",{"className":"my-4 rounded-[36px] bg-orange p-[10px] md:rounded-[48px] md:p-3","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"inset-border inset-border-dashed relative rounded-[28px] px-6 py-6 text-center font-autour text-[20px]/[28px] text-cocoa [--border-color:var(--color-brown)] [--border-width:2px] md:rounded-[38px] md:px-10 md:py-8 md:text-[25px]/[34px]","children":["“","Strangers become familiar faces one coffee at a time.","”"]}]}],["$","h2","6",{"className":"pt-4 font-autour text-[26px]/[36px] text-brown md:text-[30px]/[42px] lg:text-[32px]/[44.8px]","children":"Say hi"}],["$","p","7",{"className":"font-chiron text-[18px]/[28px] text-brown md:text-[20px]/[32px]","children":"Our favourite part of every ritual is the people. Say hello at the counter, collect your beverage and carry that friendly start into the rest of your day."}]]}]
